y  duty now and I just spoke to gambrel  this morning he says his mother is still  in the hospital as we speak the governor  there in Michigan says that the state  has the capacity to test 11,000 people  each day but she says right now they  don't have enough reagents and swabs so  they're testing at half that amount such  an important part of the storage Rika  thank you very much
 

